---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import QuestionCard from '../components/QuestionCard.astro';
import { catalog, tags, href, formatDate } from '../lib/catalog';
const { active, real, demo } = await catalog();
const usedTags = tags.filter(tag => active.some(post => post.data.tags.includes(tag.id)));
---
<Layout active="home">
  <section class="hero" data-pagefind-ignore>
    <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-line"></span>A QUESTION TODAY. KNOWLEDGE TOMORROW.</p><h1>问过的，<br />都能再<span class="accent-word">想起来<svg viewBox="0 0 250 15" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10Q110-2 245 8" /></svg></span>。</h1><p class="hero-description">把面试里的每一次提问和追问，<br class="desktop-break" />变成有迹可循、值得重温的知识。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={href('review/')}>开始一次回忆 <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a class="text-link" href={href('archive/')}>翻翻提问记录 <span>↗</span></a></div><p class="hero-footnote"><span class="live-dot"></span>由 ChatGPT Work 与 Codex 共同记录</p></div>
    <div class="recall-note"><div class="note-top"><span>THE DAILY RECALL</span><Icon name="spark" size={19} /></div><p class="note-title">不是读过，<br />是能想起来。</p><div class="note-due"><strong data-due-count>{active.length}</strong><div>道题，等你重温<small>{demo ? '先用示例体验主动回忆' : '从今天的一次回忆开始'}</small></div></div><div class="note-bottom"><span class="note-dots">{Array.from({ length: 15 }, (_, i) => <i class={i < 8 ? 'filled' : ''}></i>)}</span><span>一点点，记得更久</span></div><span class="note-tab">REVISIT / 01</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="stats-strip" aria-label="题库概览" data-pagefind-ignore><div><span class="stat-label">累计提问</span><strong>{String(real.length).padStart(2, '0')}<small>道真实记录</small></strong></div><div><span class="stat-label">知识线索</span><strong>{String(demo ? 0 : usedTags.length).padStart(2, '0')}<small>个主题标签</small></strong></div><div><span class="stat-label">最近记录</span><strong class="stat-date">{real.length ? formatDate(real[0].data.createdAt) : '等待第一道题'}<small>{demo ? '下方示例不计入你的记录' : '每个问题都有自己的时间坐标'}</small></strong></div><a class="stats-guide" href={href('guide/')}><Icon name="book" size={22} /><span>让提问自动留下来<small>查看记录指南 <span>↗</span></small></span></a></section>
  <div class="content-grid"><section><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE QUESTION JOURNAL</p><h2>{demo ? '从一道好问题开始' : '最近的提问'}</h2></div><a class="text-link small" href={href('archive/')}>全部记录 <Icon name="arrow" size={16} /></a></div>{demo && <div class="demo-banner"><span class="demo-label">示例预览</span><p>你的题库还是一张白纸。先看看它未来的样子；保存第一道题后，这里会展示你的真实记录。</p></div>}<div class="question-list">{active.slice(0, 5).map((post, index) => <QuestionCard post={post} index={index} />)}</div></section><aside class="home-aside" data-pagefind-ignore><section class="aside-section"><p class="eyebrow">CONNECT THE DOTS</p><h2>沿着标签，再想一层</h2><p class="aside-description">一个问题，也可能是另一条知识线索的起点。</p><div class="topic-list">{usedTags.map((tag, i) => <a href={href(`tags/${tag.id}/`)}><span><small>{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</small>{tag.label}</span><b>{active.filter(post => post.data.tags.includes(tag.id)).length}<Icon name="arrow" size={14} /></b></a>)}</div><a class="text-link small" href={href('tags/')}>打开标签索引 <span>↗</span></a></section><section class="flow-note"><span class="eyebrow">A SMALL ROUTINE</span><h3>提问，然后留下来。</h3><ol><li><span>01</span><div>在熟悉的地方提问<small>ChatGPT Work 或 Codex</small></div></li><li><span>02</span><div>问答自动归档<small>原题、回答，还有你的追问</small></div></li><li><span>03</span><div>每天 21:00 整理标签<small>启用 ChatGPT 定时任务后生效</small></div></li><li><span>04</span><div>回来，试着想起来<small>先回忆，再展开答案</small></div></li></ol><a href={href('guide/')} class="text-link small">配置这套日常 <Icon name="arrow" size={15} /></a></section><p class="aside-quote">“知道答案是起点，<br />能解释清楚才是自己的。”</p></aside></div>
</Layout>
